OL,3,AMen abused woman advertised by husband,
OL,4,Acourt told
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour men sexually assaulted a woman
OL,7,Fafter her then-husband drugged her and
OL,8,Fadvertised her on Craigslist, Grindr
OL,9,Fand swinging websites, a court has been
OL,10,Ftold.
OL,12,FNorman Macksoni, 48, Richard Wilkins,
OL,13,F62, Connor Sanderson-Doyle, 32, and
OL,14,FMohammed Hassan, 38, are on trial at
OL,15,FWinchester Crown Court after pleading
OL,16,Fnot guilty to sexual offences against
OL,17,FJoanne Young.
OL,19,FThey are charged jointly with her
OL,20,Fex-husband Philip Young, 50, a former
OL,21,Fcouncillor, who admitted to drugging
OL,22,Fand raping her over 13 years.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
