OL,3,ATurnout so far highest on record as
OL,4,AIsraelis vote in pivotal election
OL,5,
OL,6,FTurnout so far is at record levels, as
OL,7,FIsraelis vote in what many view as one
OL,8,Fof the most pivotal elections in the
OL,9,Fcountry's history.
OL,11,FPolling published on Friday suggests
OL,12,Fincumbent Benjamin Netanyahu is almost
OL,13,Fneck-and-neck with former military
OL,14,Fchief Gadi Eisenkot in the race to
OL,15,Fbecome prime minister.
OL,17,FBut neither of their political blocs is
OL,18,Fprojected to win the 61 seats needed to
OL,19,Fform a government - and weeks or months
OL,20,Fof political wrangling may lie ahead.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
